  title: Humayun
  text: Humayun lost his kingdom to Sher Shah Suri in 1540 and spent fifteen years in exile, partly in Persia. He regained Delhi in 1555 but died the following year. His garden tomb in Delhi is a UNESCO World Heritage Site.
